{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-4-e26","title":"晋室践阼","order":5700,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-4-e26","label":"正文 · 泰始元年","text":"晋室践阼","evidence":["wgc-q0404","wgc-q0059"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"泰始元年","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0404","wgc-q0059"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0404"}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0059","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3457f5d16116c5373b02","layer":"original","quote":"泰始元年，晋室践阼，诏曰：“昔太尉王凌谋废齐王，而王竟不足以守位〖1〗。征西将军邓艾，矜功失节，实应大辟。然被书之日〖2〗，罢遣人众，束手受罪；比于求生遂为恶者〖3〗，诚复不同。今大赦得还〖4〗，若无子孙者听使立后，令祭祀不绝。”","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0404","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3457f5d16116c5373b02","layer":"original","quote":"泰始元年，晋室践阼","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
